  "description": "Reid Classic 16 | 16 inch kids' bike\nThe perfect first pedal bike for 3–6 year olds, the Reid Classic 16\" Kids' Bike combines timeless vintage style with child-friendly design, comfort and dependable performance.\nInspired by our iconic Ladies Classic, the Classic 16\" features a stylish frame and carefully selected components designed specifically for young riders. Available in a range of beautiful colours, it includes a tan comfort saddle, matching grips and a vintage-style bell for a classic retro finish.\nSafety and confidence are key for growing riders. The front dual-pivot calliper brake provides reliable stopping power, with brake levers designed for smaller hands. A rear coaster brake allows children to stop by simply pedalling backwards, providing an intuitive braking system that's easy to learn and use.\nWhether they're riding to the park, exploring the neighbourhood or joining a family bike ride, the Reid Classic 16\" makes every adventure comfortable, confident and fun.\nWho is the Classic 16 kids' bike for?\nThe Classic 16\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n3–6 year olds ready for their first pedal bike\nYoung riders developing confidence with pedalling, steering and braking\nChildren looking for a stylish, comfortable bike with a vintage-inspired design\nParents wanting a practical kids' bike with child-friendly components\nEveryday adventures, from trips to the park to family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
